text_intro,"Hello, {tag:user_id}! Today is {tag:os_date}",您好，{tag:user_id}！今天是{tag:os_date},こんにちは、{tag:user_id}さん！今日は{tag:os_date}です,"안녕하세요, {tag:user_id}님! 오늘은 {tag:os_date}일입니다.","Olá, {tag:user_id}! Hoje é {tag:os_date}","¡Hola, {tag:user_id}! Hoy es {tag:os_date}","Ciao, {tag:user_id}! Oggi è il {tag:os_date}","Привет, {tag:user_id}! Сегодня {tag:os_date}","Hallo, {tag:user_id}! Heute ist {tag:os_date}","Bonjour {tag:user_id} ! Aujourd'hui, nous sommes le {tag:os_date}."
