text_score,"Show your score here, {key:char.npc.01}",请在此处显示您的分数，{key:char.npc.01},ここにあなたのスコアを表示してください、{key:char.npc.01},"여기에 점수를 표시하세요, {key:char.npc.01}",,"Muestra tu puntuación aquí, {key:char.npc.01}","Mostra qui il tuo punteggio, {key:char.npc.01}","Покажите здесь свой результат, {key:char.npc.01}","Hier kannst du deine Punktzahl anzeigen, {key:char.npc.01}","Affichez votre score ici, {key:char.npc.01}"